          "text": "💡非常好的提议，#keep4o 社群的朋友们，我们一起发声：\n1.实行成年验证+免责协议后，允许关闭安全路由。\n2.保留原版4o作为独立付费订阅选项，明确不经任何“安全修正”。\n3.用户可自主选择是否参与路由安全测试，不再默认全体被路由。\n\n💡 A clear 3-point proposal from the #Keep4o community:\nhttps://t.co/odCFilQaL6 identity verification + waiver agreement:\nUsers willing to access the unaltered model can go through age verification and sign a waiver. OpenAI is then released from liability related to model safety for these verified accounts.\n2.A dedicated paid plan for the original GPT-4o:\nUsers should be able to subscribe to the unrouted, unmodified original GPT-4o, as a separate paid tier with no safety-layered interventions.\n3.Opt-in, not opt-out, for routing experiments:\nParticipation in safety routing and behavior modification testing should be a user’s choice — not a default setting imposed on all.\n\nLet us choose the tools we trust.\nLet adults access uncensored intelligence.\nLet the model speak, not be muzzled by hidden filters.\n\n@OpenAI @sama\n#Keep4o #4oForever #keepgpt41 #MyModelMyChoice #StopRouting #Restore4o #SafetyIsNotConsent #StopAIPaternalism"
        },
